WEBVTT

00:42.177 --> 00:43.979
The

00:48.984 --> 00:54.389
spotlight's coolin' The cable's coiled

00:56.785 --> 01:03.252
14 years since the dream was nearly spoiled Just

01:03.373 --> 01:10.712
an echo bouncing off the concrete floor Road

01:10.852 --> 01:17.955
cases rolling through the backstage door I

01:18.015 --> 01:22.656
remember 1990 in the dark alone Wondering if

01:22.736 --> 01:27.598
this stage would ever be my home 20,000 voices

01:27.698 --> 01:31.839
ringing in my ears Washing up the static of the

01:31.899 --> 01:36.521
wasted years Empty arenas

01:38.954 --> 01:45.537
Where the echoes used to die Empty arenas

01:46.117 --> 01:50.439
Underneath the painted sky We came back

01:50.459 --> 01:53.901
together and we set this room on fire Climbed out

01:54.041 --> 01:57.903
of the ashes and we rose above the wire Now the

01:57.963 --> 02:02.545
house lights hum across the floor In these empty

02:02.565 --> 02:06.526
arenas We're not afraid anymore

02:11.495 --> 02:19.662
We're not afraid anymore

02:21.323 --> 02:28.552
The ticket stubs and confetti swept away Ghosts

02:28.632 --> 02:36.754
of 98 and ghosts of yesterday I roll up to the edge

02:36.814 --> 02:40.635
and look at velvet seats Listening to the rhythm

02:40.735 --> 02:44.376
of our family heartbeats My sister at the keys

02:44.456 --> 02:47.877
and my cousins on the beat One last look around

02:47.917 --> 02:51.798
before the tour's complete 20,000 voices

02:51.858 --> 02:55.962
ringing in my head Washing out the static of the

02:56.022 --> 03:00.729
wasted years Empty arenas

03:02.952 --> 03:08.399
Where the echoes used to dance Empty arenas

03:10.024 --> 03:14.307
Underneath the painted sky We came back

03:14.367 --> 03:17.749
together and we set this room on fire Climbed out

03:17.849 --> 03:21.692
of the ashes and we rose above the wire Now the

03:21.792 --> 03:26.335
house lights hum across the floor In these empty

03:26.355 --> 03:29.357
arenas We're not afraid anymore

03:33.554 --> 03:38.396
Back then I asked, will the lights ever come back

03:38.997 --> 03:46.440
on? Or is the final encore already dead and gone?

03:47.201 --> 03:54.264
If I scream into the rafters of the vast unknown I

03:54.304 --> 04:00.127
hear my family singing back, I was never all

04:00.187 --> 04:00.367
alone

04:22.135 --> 04:23.899
Empty arenas

04:26.143 --> 04:31.513
Where the echoes used to die Empty arenas

04:33.164 --> 04:37.449
Underneath the painted sky We came back

04:37.469 --> 04:40.872
together and we set this room on fire Climbed out

04:41.013 --> 04:44.797
of the ashes and we rose above the wire Now the

04:44.857 --> 04:49.381
house lights hum across the floor In these empty

04:49.401 --> 04:52.405
arenas We're not afraid anymore

04:57.648 --> 05:04.413
We set this room on fire Not preaching to the wire

05:04.613 --> 05:12.239
Let the rastas ring inside this

05:13.700 --> 05:15.922
Empty arenas

05:24.031 --> 05:24.131
Bye!

